                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' FF performance from fast to slow, hard to easy, amount of messages:"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 1. FF by time and not send any messages ' fastest, easiest, not practical"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 2. FF by message and not send any messages ' fastest, easiest, not practical"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 3. FF by time and send only important messages ' faster than option 5, hardest to implement, most practical"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 4. FF by message and send only important messages ' faster than option 5, hardest to implement, most practical"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 5. FF by time, send all messages, and filter late notes ' faster than option 7, too many messages"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 6. FF by message, send all messages, and filter late notes ' faster than option 7, too many messages"
                          - kind: Newline
                            text: "\n"
                          - kind: Whitespace
                            text: "        "
                          - kind: EndOfLineComment
                            text: "' 7. Without any filtering, then option 5 and 6 are the slowest."
