              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "'-------------------------------------------------------------------"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' Filter duplicate message commands whose details"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' are not critical which could slow down the program."
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' The exact number of messages that will be disabled"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' is not crucial. The log file if any only needs to know"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' that it occurred. This will help prepare any midi output"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' with as few messages as possible. Keeping like patches,"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' banks, some controllers and no duplicates."
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' (see 1.00.568)"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' Fast by scanning original data only once."
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' WARNING,"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' Also disables messages that represent on/off"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' parameters as triggers when change from zero to 127."
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' Would have been better to keep the most recent"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' triggered pair or comparable group. Would have been"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' best to at least keep the min and max values and"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' not just one value."
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' WARNING,"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' Only removing duplicate commands, not duplicate"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' commands and values. Since duplicate commands"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' may contain different values, assuming the last value"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' was more important. Also assuming input sends data"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' in correct order in first place, no extra nrpn after"
              - kind: Newline
                text: "\n"
              - kind: Whitespace
                text: "    "
              - kind: EndOfLineComment
                text: "' data entry, etc. otherwise if sent in wrong order,"
              - kind: Newline
